      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Apr-23-2015 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled this day for OSC hearing for Name Change.<br>Dept. 514, Judge: Charles Crompton, Clerk: Yolanda Mazariegos, CSR: Mitch Lyon, #6840<br>Clifford Y. Wang, Esq., appearing for Petitiners: JiFu Li and Lie Huang; father and mother of minor present in court. <br>Petitioners sworn and examined through Cantonese Interpreter attorney Clifford Y. Wang.<br>Proof of Publication on file.<br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct and sufficient, and that the petition should be granted.<br>The court grants the petition for Change of Name of minor from Yong Yu Li to Weny Li.<br>The court also grants the petition for Change of Name of (mother) Lie Huang to Lily Huang.<br>Decree Changing Names signed in open court.",
